   "boundElements": [],
   "text": "*  harness/bindings.yaml is the only file here that\n   names a tool. No criterion ever does \u2014 which is what\n   makes tool migration one edit and a regeneration.\n\nOne criterion per file \u00b7 nothing edited in place except a\nconfirmation date \u00b7 nothing ever deleted.",
